Description:It is your first main phase. You control a tapped Mountain and a tapped Swamp, have not played a land, and have Island, Savannah (Forest Plains) and Tribal Flames (domain: X damage to any target, X = basic land types among your lands) in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-domain-dual-types | Domain counts basic land types, and a land with two types counts both (CR 305.6, 205.3i): play Savannah for Mountain, Swamp, Forest and Plains, 4 damage; the Island gives only 3
